                                            <script>
                                                const faqData = {
                                                    general: [
                                                        {
                                                            q: "What is a neo bank?",
                                                            a: "A neo bank is a digital-only financial provider offering accounts, cards, payments, and credit through mobile apps. It usually operates under a partner-bank or e-money licence rather than a full banking charter, which lets it launch faster and operate at lower cost than a traditional branch-based bank."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "What is neo banking?",
                                                            a: "Neo banking is the app-first banking model that replaces branches with digital onboarding, real-time spending controls, and personalised services. Customers open and manage accounts, cards, and loans entirely from their phones, often with lower fees and faster support than legacy banks."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "How do neo banks make money?",
                                                            a: "Neo banks earn from card interchange, lending interest and fees, premium subscriptions, FX and transfer fees, and partner referral commissions. Many also add business accounts and, increasingly, crypto services to diversify revenue beyond interchange."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "What are white label neo banking solutions?",
                                                            a: "White label neo banking solutions are pre-built, rebrandable neo banking platforms that you launch under your own name. They include the ledger, apps, KYC, cards, payments, and back office, so you skip the multi-year build and focus on acquiring customers."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "What is a crypto neo bank?",
                                                            a: "A crypto neo bank combines fiat accounts with crypto wallets, conversions, staking, and crypto-linked cards in one app. A white-label crypto neo bank platform lets you launch this model under your brand without building custody and ledger infrastructure yourself."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "Who is a leading neo banking solutions provider?",
                                                            a: "A leading neo banking solutions provider should show live platforms in production, a tested ledger, built-in compliance, clear licence guidance, and full code ownership. Clarisco offers all five and gives you a capability call before any commitment."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "Can traditional banks use a neo banking platform?",
                                                            a: "Yes. Banks and credit unions use neo banking platforms to launch a digital sub-brand without re-platforming their legacy core. The new brand runs on its own stack while integrating with the bank's licence, funding, and risk systems."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "Do I need a banking licence to launch a neo bank?",
                                                            a: "Not always. Many neo banks launch under a partner bank, a Banking-as-a-Service provider, or an e-money licence depending on the jurisdiction. We map the right model to your market during scoping, though you should confirm requirements with local legal counsel."
                                                        }
                                                    ],

                                                    business: [
                                                        {
                                                            q: "What does your white label neo bank development company deliver?",
                                                            a: "We deliver the ledger, customer apps, KYC, card issuing, payments, lending, admin console, and integrations, configured to your brand and jurisdictions. After launch we provide full source code handover and optional ongoing support."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "How does neo bank lending software work?",
                                                            a: "Neo bank lending software takes a customer from application through credit decisioning, e-signature, disbursement, repayment, and collections in one connected workflow. Because it is tied to the customer's account and the ledger, balances and schedules update in real time."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "What does a neo bank loan management system do?",
                                                            a: "A neo bank loan management system manages repayment schedules, interest accrual, fees, restructuring, delinquency tracking, and provisioning across the whole portfolio. It also produces the portfolio and regulatory reports lenders need for management and audit."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "What products do lending software solutions for neo banks support?",
                                                            a: "They support personal loans, buy-now-pay-later, overdrafts, SME credit lines, and crypto-collateralised loans. Credit policy, pricing, and schedules are configured through the admin console, so new products launch without custom development."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "How does crypto neo banking app development differ from a standard neo bank build?",
                                                            a: "It adds custody, on/off-ramps, multi-asset wallets, price feeds, and collateral management to the same account structure and ledger. The result is one app and one balance sheet view instead of two disconnected systems."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "Which payment rails does the platform support?",
                                                            a: "We connect to SEPA, ACH, Faster Payments, SWIFT, and local instant-payment schemes through certified partners. Availability depends on your jurisdictions and partner-bank arrangements, which we confirm during discovery."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "Can the platform integrate with my existing banking partner or card processor?",
                                                            a: "Yes. We integrate with BaaS providers, sponsor banks, and card processors through APIs. If your partner has specific technical requirements, we review them in scoping and plan the connection into the schedule."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "Which AI features are included in the platform?",
                                                            a: "Credit scoring, fraud detection, KYC document verification, collections optimisation, churn prediction, a customer support assistant, and AML alert triage. Each can be enabled progressively as your data volume grows."
                                                        }
                                                    ],

                                                    pricing: [
                                                        {
                                                            q: "How much does a white label neo bank cost?",
                                                            a: "Cost depends on the number of products, markets, integrations, and whether crypto and lending are included. A fiat-only launch typically costs less than a crypto neo bank with lending. We provide a line-item estimate before you sign any contract."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "How long does neo banking platform development take?",
                                                            a: "A configured white-label launch averages about 4 weeks from kick-off to go-live. Highly customised scope, multiple jurisdictions, or slow partner-bank approvals can extend this, and we confirm a week-by-week plan during scoping."
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            q: "What does neo bank loan management software cost?",
                                                            a: "It varies with the loan products, integrations, and reporting required. It can be added to an existing neo bank or deployed as part of a new platform, and we scope it separately so you can see its cost clearly."
